  insert into public.lms_lessons (course_id, position, section, title, body) values (cid, 3, $tw$Chapter 2: Careers in AI$tw$, $tw$AI Careers: Jobs of the Future$tw$, $tw$### Core AI Careers

| Career | What They Do | Example Work |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **AI Engineer** | Build intelligent systems that allow computers to learn and make decisions. | Chatbots, recommendation systems, smart assistants |
| **Machine Learning Engineer** | Design algorithms that help computers learn from data automatically. | Image recognition, fraud detection |
| **Data Scientist** | Study large sets of data to discover patterns and insights. | Predict trends, analyze customer behavior |
| **AI Research Scientist** | Explore new ideas and technologies that improve artificial intelligence. | Develop new AI models and algorithms |
| **Robotics Engineer** | Design and program robots that perform tasks automatically. | Factory robots, delivery robots |
| **Computer Vision Engineer** | Build systems that allow computers to understand images and videos. | Self-driving cars, facial recognition |
| **Natural Language Processing (NLP) Engineer** | Create systems that help computers understand human language. | Chatbots, translation tools |
| **AI Product Manager** | Lead teams that design and build AI-powered products. | Planning features for AI apps |
| **Automation Engineer** | Develop systems that automate tasks normally done by humans. | Warehouse robots, automated factories |

## Responsible AI Careers

| Career | What They Do | Example Work |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **AI Ethicist** | Ensure AI systems are fair, safe, and used responsibly. | Prevent bias in algorithms |
| **AI Policy Specialist** | Help governments create rules and laws for safe AI use. | AI regulations and governance |
| **AI Safety Researcher** | Study how to make advanced AI systems safe and reliable. | Risk analysis for AI systems |
| **Privacy Engineer** | Protect people's data when AI systems collect information. | Data protection systems |

## Creative AI Careers

| Career | What They Do | Example Work |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **AI Game Developer** | Use AI to make games more interactive and challenging. | Smart game characters |
| **AI Artist** | Use AI tools to create digital art, music, and animations. | AI-generated artwork |
| **AI Content Creator** | Create videos, graphics, and stories using AI tools. | Educational content, media production |
| **AI Interaction Designer** | Design how humans interact with AI systems. | Voice assistants, chatbot interfaces |

